@startuml
title SEQUENCE - ADMIN MODERATION

skinparam dpi 150
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14
skinparam NoteFontSize 14
skinparam maxMessageSize 55
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantFontSize 15
  ActorFontSize 15
  ArrowFontSize 14
  ParticipantPadding 42
  BoxPadding 18
  MessageAlign center
  LifeLineBorderColor #6B7C93
  ParticipantBorderColor #1F4E79
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF2F8
}
autonumber

actor "Chủ quán" as Owner
actor "Quản trị viên" as Admin
participant AdminController
participant AdminService
database PostgreSQL
participant "Public API" as PublicAPI

Owner -> AdminController: GET /api/v1/admin/restaurants
AdminController --> Owner: 403 Forbidden

Admin -> AdminController: GET /api/v1/admin/restaurants
AdminController -> AdminService: listRestaurants(page, size)
AdminService -> PostgreSQL: Query danh sách phân trang
PostgreSQL --> AdminService: PagedResponse
AdminService --> AdminController: Danh sách nhà hàng
AdminController --> Admin: 200 OK

group Moderation restaurant
  Admin -> AdminController: PATCH /restaurants/{restaurantId}/hide hoặc /unhide
  AdminController -> AdminService: hideRestaurant(restaurantId) /\nunhideRestaurant(restaurantId)
  AdminService -> PostgreSQL: Lock restaurant và đặt HIDDEN / ACTIVE
  PostgreSQL --> AdminService: Updated
  AdminService --> AdminController: Hoàn tất
  AdminController --> Admin: 204 No Content
end

group Moderation video / nguồn / proof
  Admin -> AdminController: PATCH endpoint hide hoặc unhide tương ứng
  AdminController -> AdminService: hideVideo(videoId) / unhideVideo(videoId) /\nhideIngredientSource(sourceId) / unhideIngredientSource(sourceId) /\nhideRecentProof(proofId) / unhideRecentProof(proofId)
  AdminService -> PostgreSQL: Lock tài nguyên và kiểm tra transition
  alt State transition hợp lệ
    PostgreSQL --> AdminService: Updated
    AdminService --> AdminController: Hoàn tất
    AdminController --> Admin: 204 No Content
  else Xung đột trạng thái
    PostgreSQL --> AdminService: Conflict
    AdminService --> AdminController: Conflict
    AdminController --> Admin: 409 Conflict
  end
end

Admin -> PublicAPI: GET public restaurant detail
PublicAPI --> Admin: 404 nếu restaurant HIDDEN

note over Admin, PostgreSQL
  Admin Console hiện có UI cho list/hide/unhide restaurant.
  Moderation tài nguyên con và user được kiểm tra qua API/Postman.
end note
@enduml
